+ * first display like a removed GPU ("device_lost":true,"removed_reason":"0x887a0005" in the event).
+ * ffp_probe_caps: presenters[] gets {"name":"d3d11","ok":..,"error":"","inputs":["d3d11","system"],
+ * "import":{"cuda":false},"vp":{"rotate":..,"mirror":..,"procamp":..,"brightness":[min,max],
+ * "contrast":[min,max],"saturation":[min,max],"deinterlace":[..],"telecine":..},"shader":false} (brightness in ffmpeg eq
+ * units * 100, contrast / saturation in ffmpeg eq units) and features gets "presenter_d3d11" and "presenter_params".
+ * ffp_get_debug_info: "renderer" is "d3d11:videoprocessor" while the presenter draws. */
